    "text": "fox35orlando.com\nwebsite\nDeland\nFlorida father charged after toddler found alone outside, police say\n49 minutes ago\nDELAND, Fla. - A DeLand man is facing multiple charges after police say he left his 2-year-old son crying and alone in a front yard and then drove off while intoxicated. Police in DeLand say 37-year-old Bobby Vinson is facing multiple charges after allegedly leaving his 2-year-old son unattended in a yard and driving off while intoxicated. The child was found alone, crying, and visibly distressed in a dimly lit front yard around 12:30 a.m. Tuesday.",
